{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 130,
    "dDurationMs": 5300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Do you think there is life beyond the earth?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5430,
    "dDurationMs": 3459,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Yes, I do."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 8889,
    "dDurationMs": 3460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Why is that?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 12349,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Scientifically been proven?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 14809,
    "dDurationMs": 1400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Are we alone?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 16209,
    "dDurationMs": 2781,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Or is there life elsewhere in the universe?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 18990,
    "dDurationMs": 5480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is a question humans have wondered about\nfor millennia and one that people still have"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 24470,
    "dDurationMs": 4180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "pretty strong opinions about even though there\nisn’t definitive evidence to answer the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 28650,
    "dDurationMs": 2249,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "question one way or the other."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 30899,
    "dDurationMs": 5811,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Do you think that aliens have ever come\nto earth?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 36710,
    "dDurationMs": 3010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e People say that there is like... there\nhas been aliens and they implant..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 39720,
    "dDurationMs": 5700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I forget what it is called, but they have\nlike made these fields and they have like"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 45420,
    "dDurationMs": 1819,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "produced something on earth."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 47239,
    "dDurationMs": 2491,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e I think Area 51 could be possible and could\nbe real."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 49730,
    "dDurationMs": 3010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e You know how there is area 51 and all that\nkind of stuff."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 52740,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I reckon they have got technology that they\nwon’t bring it out yet, you know."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 55800,
    "dDurationMs": 2140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Do you think it is technology that came\nfrom aliens?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 57940,
    "dDurationMs": 1070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Well, possibly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 59010,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They could have."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 60010,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They could be sharing information and gaining\ntechnology from aliens."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 62710,
    "dDurationMs": 3740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e On YouTube there seems to be some pretty\ngood evidence about it, but I don’t know."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 66450,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e You have seen some videos of aliens."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 68070,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 69070,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e That looked convincing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 70070,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Kind of, yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 71070,
    "dDurationMs": 6990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e So {?} apparently were beings that came\ndown from heaven according to the old Sumerian"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 78060,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "texts."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 79060,
    "dDurationMs": 3860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e The oil paintings and stuff and Sumeria."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 82920,
    "dDurationMs": 4430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e I think people believe that aliens have\nvisited us just because they are not aware"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 87350,
    "dDurationMs": 2559,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of how vast the universe really is."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 89909,
    "dDurationMs": 2651,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, what is an exoplanet?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 92560,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How far is a light year?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 94840,
    "dDurationMs": 3769,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These are the things you need to understand\nif you are to judge the probability that alien"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 98609,
    "dDurationMs": 2150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "life could come and visit us."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 100759,
    "dDurationMs": 4070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What is a galaxy?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 104829,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Specifically I wouldn’t know."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 106149,
    "dDurationMs": 5960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Is a galaxy something totally different,\nlike another universe maybe?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 112109,
    "dDurationMs": 3131,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e A galaxy is a sun and a moon, isn’t it?\u003e\u003e"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 115240,
    "dDurationMs": 7620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So a galaxy is bigger than that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 122860,
    "dDurationMs": 3930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Galaxies, hundreds of stars, blah, blah,\nblah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 126790,
    "dDurationMs": 1910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e In fact, hundreds of billions of stars."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 128700,
    "dDurationMs": 1070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Billions of stars."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 129770,
    "dDurationMs": 1340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Yeah, hundreds of billions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 131110,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Yeah, yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 132110,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e What is a galaxy?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 133110,
    "dDurationMs": 4970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is a collection of stars and gas that are\nheld together in a gravitationally bound system."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 138080,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Every point of light that you see here is\na star."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 140990,
    "dDurationMs": 3410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When we say 200 billion stars, it is probably\nat least 200 billion stars."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 144400,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The galaxy is 100,000 light years across."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 147340,
    "dDurationMs": 5100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, you know, it is just... the distances\nare unimaginable."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 152440,
    "dDurationMs": 2470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One light year, don’t forget, is 10 trillion\nkilometers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 154910,
    "dDurationMs": 1260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e What is a light year?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 156170,
    "dDurationMs": 1330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You are an engineer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 157500,
    "dDurationMs": 2050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e A light year is a thousand years, isn’t\nit?\u003e\u003e"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 159550,
    "dDurationMs": 1640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A light year is a thousand years?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 161190,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Isn’t it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 162190,
    "dDurationMs": 1450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Oh, about 150 million years..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 163640,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Would be a light year."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 164640,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Would be a light year."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 165640,
    "dDurationMs": 1690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is what I believe it would be."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 167330,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e It is a distance."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 168330,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Is it a distance?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 169330,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A light year?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 170330,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Have you heard the term exoplanet?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 171330,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e No."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 172330,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e No."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 173330,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Never."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 174330,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Exoplanet."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 175330,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 176330,
    "dDurationMs": 1580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Like a planet that we are not aware?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 177910,
    "dDurationMs": 3249,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Well, exo should be... could be short for\nsomething."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 181159,
    "dDurationMs": 2871,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Extraterrestrial planet or extraterrestrial\nlife, maybe."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 184030,
    "dDurationMs": 1470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Something outside our planet."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 185500,
    "dDurationMs": 5090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e So an exoplanet is simply a planet that\norbits a star other than the sun."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 190590,
    "dDurationMs": 4610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Exo just means external, outside, so outside\nour solar system."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 195200,
    "dDurationMs": 1110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it is just a planet."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 196310,
    "dDurationMs": 1450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You know, you can..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 197760,
    "dDurationMs": 1300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e How many have you found?\u003e\u003e"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 199060,
    "dDurationMs": 1340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Me personally?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 200400,
    "dDurationMs": 2330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I have found six."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 202730,
    "dDurationMs": 6950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But overall we now know of over 800 planets\nthat have been confirmed and another probably"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 209680,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "2000 planets that are waiting for information,\nbut are pretty strong candidates."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 213760,
    "dDurationMs": 4860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So we don’t see the planet directly, we\nsee its impact on the start that it orbits."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 218620,
    "dDurationMs": 6230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We do it from the ground with a angle Australian\ntelescope and we look for the wobble of the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 224850,
    "dDurationMs": 1430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "star as the planet orbits it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 226280,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The planet goes around and the start moves\nbackwards and forwards."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 229580,
    "dDurationMs": 4690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So if you can imagine seeing that from sort\nof along the line of sight a little bit more,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 234270,
    "dDurationMs": 6380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "say like in this cartoon here, then you would\nsee the star moving towards you and moving"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 240650,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "away from you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 241650,
    "dDurationMs": 5700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so what we see here is the light from\nthe star becoming ever so slightly bluer as"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 247350,
    "dDurationMs": 4390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it moves towards us and ever so slightly redder\nas it moves away."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 251740,
    "dDurationMs": 4420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The big problem is that the main kind of planet\nyou end up finding with this wobble technique,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 256160,
    "dDurationMs": 5150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because it is really reliant on the mass of\nthe planet, basically like Jupiter, Saturn"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 261310,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then we have started to get down to Neptune\nand Uranus."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 263830,
    "dDurationMs": 6420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e To find smaller planets NASA launched Kepler,\na one meter telescope with a 95 megapixel"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 270250,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "camera."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 271250,
    "dDurationMs": 5570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Its mission is to observe 130,000 stars in\nour galaxy and look for dips in brightness"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 276820,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "caused by planets passing in front of them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 279420,
    "dDurationMs": 5520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e So Kepler-62 is a solar system with five\nplanets and the planets are very similar in"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 284940,
    "dDurationMs": 4470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "size to the terrestrial planets, the rocky\nplanets in our own solar system."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 289410,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They have a star in the middle and then you\nhave three inner planets."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 292310,
    "dDurationMs": 4230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There is a green band which is this habitable\nzone, the goldilocks zone where you can expect"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 296540,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "liquid water to exist on the surface of the\nplanet."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 299840,
    "dDurationMs": 3710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And, in fact, there are two planets inside\nthe habitable zone around Kepler-62."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 303550,
    "dDurationMs": 4870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you are going to start looking for life\naround nearby stars, this is probably the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 308420,
    "dDurationMs": 1279,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "best one to start with."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 309699,
    "dDurationMs": 2261,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Is there life beyond the earth?\u003e\u003e"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 311960,
    "dDurationMs": 1679,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well we don’t know for sure."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 313639,
    "dDurationMs": 2351,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We can’t say yes definitely."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 315990,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But the probability is very high."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 317910,
    "dDurationMs": 2020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There are at least 200 billion stars in our\ngalaxy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 319930,
    "dDurationMs": 4980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We now know that on average there is at least\none planet per star in our galaxy alone and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 324910,
    "dDurationMs": 3930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there are another 100 plus billion galaxies\nin the universe."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 328840,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We also now know, thanks to the Kepler spacecraft,\nthat at least one in six of those is earth"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 333480,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "sized."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 334480,
    "dDurationMs": 3659,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so that is 33 billion potential earth\nsized planets."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 338139,
    "dDurationMs": 1781,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Not all of them are going to be able to have\nlife."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 339920,
    "dDurationMs": 2950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But the probability is getting pretty high\nalready at this stage."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 342870,
    "dDurationMs": 5480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e So there is no definitive evidence that\nalien life exists, but the sheer size of the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 348350,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "numbers suggest that they must be out there\nsomewhere."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 351710,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But with the vast distances across the universe,\nchances are it is going to be a long time"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 356030,
    "dDurationMs": 4419,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "before we know for certain that we are not\nalone."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 360449,
    "dDurationMs": 6891,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This video was created as part of a collaboration\naddressing 10 unanswered science questions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 367340,
    "dDurationMs": 4090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So subscribe to Veritasium and then check\nout the other nine questions by clicking the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 371430,
    "dDurationMs": 2299,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "link."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 373729,
    "dDurationMs": 2311,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Ok."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 376040,
    "dDurationMs": 3270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Is there more than one galaxy out there?"
